      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Hungary, and popular across Austria and Slovakia. Served at Sunday lunches and in traditional restaurants alongside egg noodles or spaetzle. A gentle, paprika-red dish with none of the heat that might be expected." }]
